# Title: Tamper Windows Defender Remove-MpPreference - ScriptBlockLogging
# ID: ae2bdd58-0681-48ac-be7f-58ab4e593458
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-05
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects attempts to remove Windows Defender configuration using the 'MpPreference' cmdlet
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((ScriptBlockText CONTAIN "Remove-MpPreference") AND ((ScriptBlockText CONTAIN "-ControlledFolderAccessProtectedFolders " OR ScriptBlockText CONTAIN "-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Ids " OR ScriptBlockText CONTAIN "-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Actions " OR ScriptBlockText CONTAIN "-CheckForSignaturesBeforeRunningScan ")))
